      "source_example_id": "e-5959",
      "knowledge_point": "Finding a QR Factorization of a Matrix Given an Orthogonal Basis in Terms of the Columns of a Matrix",
      "kp_id": "e-5959"
    },
    "q-41486": {
      "dom_id": "step-q41486",
      "name": "Question 12",
      "problem": "$$\n\\overset{A}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}| & | & | \\\\ {a}_{1} & {a}_{2} & {a}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{aligned}]}}=\\overset{Q}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}| & | & | \\\\ {q}_{1} & {q}_{2} & {q}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{aligned}]}}\\overset{R}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}{r}_{11} & {r}_{12} & {r}_{13} \\\\ 0 & {r}_{22} & {r}_{23} \\\\ 0 & 0 & {r}_{33}\\end{aligned}]}}\n$$\n\nConsider the QR factorization of the matrix $A$ shown above. You're given that the system of equations given below connects the columns of $Q$ and the columns of $A.$\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{q}_{1}=\\frac{1}{6}{a}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}{a}_{2}+8{q}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{3}=\\frac{1}{3}{a}_{3}-3{q}_{1}+2{q}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhat is the value of ${r}_{13}+{r}_{22}+{r}_{33}?$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's rewrite the vectors ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}$ as a linear combination of the vectors ${q}_{1},{q}_{2},{q}_{3}:$\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{q}_{1}=\\frac{1}{6}{a}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}{a}_{2}+8{q}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{3}=\\frac{1}{3}{a}_{3}-3{q}_{1}+2{q}_{2}\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,\\{\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1}=6{q}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{2}=-16{q}_{1}+2{q}_{2} \\\\ {a}_{3}=9{q}_{1}-6{q}_{2}+3{q}_{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, this system can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\overset{A}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}| & | & | \\\\ {a}_{1} & {a}_{2} & {a}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{aligned}]}}=\\overset{Q}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}| & | & | \\\\ {q}_{1} & {q}_{2} & {q}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{aligned}]}}\\overset{R}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}6 & -16 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n{r}_{13}+{r}_{22}+{r}_{33}=9+2+3=14.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-41486-a",
